            when false -> default_val

## @deprecated Use `enchanting result of shard T to shard E` instead.
## Legacy methods of `ResultInt`, invoked as `calling r.is_ok` / `r.unwrap`.
enchanting ResultInt:
    ## Returns `true` when the result holds a value (mirrors the `is_ok` field).
    ##
    ## ## Retorno
